#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Homeless Man"
msgid "Hey, Akiyama! You look like you got some time on your hands. As always."
msgstr "¡Eh, Akiyama! Parece que tienes algo de tiempo libre. Como siempre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "Look who's talking... So how's it going? Are you able to\\r\ntake baths now and then?"
msgstr "Mira quien habla... ¿Cómo te encuentras tu?\\r \n¿Te bañas de vez en cuando?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Homeless Man"
msgid "If I had money for the public baths, I'd spend it on booze.\\r\nI just had one of them oil drum baths, though. Didn't cost\\r\na thing!"
msgstr "Si tuviera dinero para el baño público, yo lo gastaría\\r\nen alcohol. Así que, mejor me di un baño en un barril.\\r\n¡No costó nada!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "You'll catch a cold, though... Whatever. Take a look\\r\nat this. If you ever see this guy, would you please let me\\r\nknow? Here's some money for the phone call."
msgstr "Vas a resfriarte... Bueno, como sea. ¿Puedes llamarme\\r\nsi ves a este tipo? Aquí te dejo 100 yenes para llamar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Homeless Man"
msgid "Whoa, that's terrible! Did you draw this?"
msgstr "¡¿Que es eso?! Es horrible. ¿Tu lo dibujaste?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "Who, me? No way. But apparently it's pretty accurate. Mind\\r\nasking your friends to keep an eye out, too?"
msgstr "¿Yo? Nah, imposible. Pero, me han dicho que es muy parecido.\\r\n¿Podrías pedirle también a tus amigos que lo busquen?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Homeless Man"
msgid "Leave it to me. And feel free to bring us some goodies again anytime!"
msgstr "Dejámelo a mi. ¡No olvides de volver con regalos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "I'd be happy to. Thanks again."
msgstr "Claro, lo haré. Muchas gracias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Akiyama"
msgid "(Maybe I'll wander around town a bit myself. Seriously, though, this guy can't really be that ugly... can he?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ya es hora de vagar por Kamurocho. Pero, ¿En serio existe alguien tan horrible...?)"

